#: blocks/team-member/block.json build/blocks/team-member/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Team Member"
msgstr "Teamlid"

#: blocks/team-member/block.json build/blocks/team-member/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"One person: photo, name, role, optional short bio and email and LinkedIn "
"links."
msgstr ""
"Eén persoon: foto, naam, functie, optioneel een korte bio en e-mail- en "
"LinkedIn-links."

#: blocks/team/block.json build/blocks/team/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Team"
msgstr "Team"

#: blocks/team/block.json build/blocks/team/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"People with photo, name, role and contact links. Variants: cards (portrait "
"photos) and compact (small round photos, for contact cards)."
msgstr ""
"Mensen met foto, naam, functie en contactlinks. Varianten: kaarten (staande "
"foto’s) en compact (kleine ronde foto’s, voor contactkaarten)."

